triangular matrix since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrices $B$ and $C$ are *not* upper triangular matrices since they each have a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{31} & =5\\ne 0 \\\\ {c}_{32} & =3\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262617 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eb56e3e4-d13e-506f-b457-467943ab9482" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437746} {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437747} :answer-field/id #uuid "1080d492-9821-5364-8530-4c7dbd0bd3c0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438902} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a0f61d8-2bc9-5ba5-8d56-d3b975c8bf07" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437748} {:answer/id #uuid "0e783ddd-e977-54e7-8580-da07e92b8e98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e783ddd-e977-54e7-8580-da07e92b8e98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437749} :answer-field/id #uuid "771187b2-e28f-5a7d-a91d-34f73489e1ad" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438903} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "520ef5db-e43e-5e23-92a0-3ed7c62386b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437750} {:answer/id #uuid "6e998b87-0e1c-59a3-830c-e099cf52d227" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e998b87-0e1c-59a3-830c-e099cf52d227" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437751} :answer-field/id #uuid "c1bcc754-87e4-5cec-9f4e-5a5e7e36cb54" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438904}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f41ff7d0-b754-5033-a620-53eef8a376e3" :question/math-academy-id "q-126479" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$C=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $C$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $C$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** ${C}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${C}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"."}]}
